why bootstrap is there in folderstructure ?
In the second architecture (Pure Database-Driven), the bootstrap/ folder exists because of a classic "chicken-and-egg" problem: 
your Databricks batch job needs to read a database table (pipeline_metadata) to know what to run,
so those database tables must exist before the framework can run for the very first time.



